{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791073350,"nonce":"ZVV9aQnCqG3nnee2os0+PTCWvg0=","title":"Built-ins follow the HID guidelines: theme motion, shape and colour tokens for every micro motion","message":"User direction (2026-10-04): HID guidelines apply to built-in interactive and form elements. Corners: the theme's squircle on radii of considerable size (done in 1d1016c: UA radii from --radius-* tokens). Motion: every hover, press and focus change eases on the theme's motion tokens; focused text inputs, checkboxes and radios grow an outline ring out with the easing, a small gap from the border; dialogs grow in from nothing, not only fade, as blinc_cn's dialog does (scale_in_with(200, ease_sheet), scale_out_with(150, ease_sheet)). Colour and shadow from tokens.\n\nDone:\n- UA: hover/press colours --duration-fast --ease-state; focus ring outline 0 -\u003e 3px in --focus-ring, 2px offset, --duration-fast --ease-out; press scale over --duration-faster; check mark and radio dot scale in with --ease-spring; dialog grows in/shrinks out on --ease-sheet, backdrop fades; select list scales in, chevron turns while [open]; progress/meter bars ease to new values. Shadows from --shadow-*, exported by ThemeState.\n- TopLayer marks a closing entry [closing], keeps it --duration-faster for its exit animation, and lets presses pass through it meanwhile (blinc_abi hit test pass-through, CSS pointer-events: none semantics).\n- Dialog marks [open] when shown, so its opening animation starts then.","files":null}]}